abstract: >
  foxmakers-open-cad-kit is an open-source Python library for parametric 3D mesh
  generation, STL repair, and STEP conversion using Manifold3D and Trimesh.
  It provides certified 2-manifold STL utilities and 8 ready-to-print models
  for the additive manufacturing community.
